## Context

The sidecar is a TypeScript Express server that runs the Claude Agent SDK. It currently discovers skills once at startup and stores them in a const `ALLOWED_SKILLS` Set. We need to change this to per-request discovery so that skills created at runtime (via the REST API or MCP tool) are immediately available without restarting the container.

The `skillAllowlistHook` prevents the agent from invoking built-in skills that are bundled with the Claude Code binary (like "simplify"). The system prompt also includes a restriction to prevent the model from even suggesting those skills.

